e.Hosting 13.6.4 with NU1903. Update the coherent 13.6 Aspire family, matching integration previews and AppHost SDK to 13.6.5, which includes the hosting and Dashboard security fixes ([hosting advisory](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-f7vh-h5g3-7jrh), [Dashboard advisory](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-4g86-54fm-h9h8)).\n\nOnly the thirteen Aspire package pins and AppHost SDK property change. Preserve every other package pin and all unselected audit families; refresh only the normal `aspire` audit family. The selected patch versions already exist in released executor source 6ad5854aa14a9950e1fbfc32d7e27953a1c4b82b; no other changes from that source are imported.\n\nValidation: the normal audit validator and authoritative catalog metadata validator passed; all 90 catalog controls passed on identical catalog bytes. Locked dependency signatures, full commit messages and real version analysis passed (prospective 4.44.15). Normal exact-source PR CI, merged-source CI and actual-version publication qualification remain required. No audit exception, native/caller acceptance or current-cohort registration is introduced.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> Patches Aspire hosting and AppHost SDK versions used by module AppHosts; narrow dependency-only change but affects local/cloud orchestration and addresses a known security advisory on 13.6.4.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> **Centrally pins the supported Aspire 13.6 stack from 13.6.4 to 13.6.5**, including `HexalithAspireAppHostSdkVersion` and all thirteen related `PackageVersion` entries in `Directory.Packages.props`. Stable hosting/integration packages move to **13.6.5**; **Aspire.Hosting.Keycloak** and **Aspire.Hosting.Kubernetes** move to the matching **13.6.5-preview** builds so the family stays aligned.\n> \n> **Regenerates only the `aspire` slice of `Tools/package-version-audit.json`**: updated catalog hashes, audit timestamp, refreshed package metadata for the new pins, and appended v2 historical records for the superseded 13.6.4 observations. Other audit families are preserved unchanged.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit f934342d541f9802ce5a987a65c60af868ec6d5c. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-17T19:04:04Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T19:09:52Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"66c6d1598937218ec3c74e1f8bf585fd69e486c5","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"tinouit","id":183023925,"node_id":"U_kgDOCui5NQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/183023925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit","html_url":"https://github.com/tinouit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tinouit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Hexalith:fix/story-2-8-aspire-maintenance","ref":"fix/story-2-8-aspire-maintenance","repo":{"id":952945989,"node_id":"R_kgDOOMzNRQ","name":"Hexalith.Builds","full_name":"Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds","owner":{"login":"Hexalith","id":80614290,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjgwNjE0Mjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80614290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.